  "terraReviewChecklist": [
    "public index exposes no transport or durable coordinator constructor",
    "durable coordinator has no caller-replaceable provider authority",
    "authoritative ACK envelope is persisted byte-for-byte as the committed vault entry",
    "draft fingerprint, operation, project, client, actor, payload, and revision identities are rechecked",
    "remote tail is persisted before OrderKeeper apply",
    "lease fencing, duplicate, gap, retry, and restart recovery remain idempotent",
    "direct Event object substitution is rejected",
    "restored OrderKeeper starts from canonical committed receipts and does not reapply completed operations",
